              (icons/city_seal_full.png) would push the 222px sidebar wide open.
              If you ever swap the artwork, resize to 96x96 first and keep the
              matching icons/city_seal-2x.png at 192x192 for high-DPI screens. -->
         <property name="pixmap"><pixmap resource="resources.qrc">:/icons/city_seal.png</pixmap></property>
